      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon.\nRestituisce gradualmente PS ai Pokémon di tipo\nVeleno, ma danneggia tutti gli altri.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. It gradually\nrestores HP to Poison-type Pokémon. It damages\nany other type.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせると　どくタイプの　ポケモンは\n少しずつ　ＨＰを　回復する。\nそれ以外は　ＨＰが　減ってしまう。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "携带后，毒属性的宝可梦\n会缓缓回复ＨＰ。\n其他属性的话，ＨＰ则会减少。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si lo lleva un Pokémon de tipo Veneno, restaura\ngradualmente sus PS durante el combate. Si es de otro\ntipo, sus PS se reducirán.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
  ],
